    "sections": {
        "description": "The FSE Home Decor is a visually captivating and fully customizable theme designed for interior designers, home stylists, decorators, and creative professionals. Whether you’re a design expert or run a boutique for home accessories, this theme helps you create an elegant and modern online presence. With full-site editing capabilities, you can easily customize every section header, footer, templates, and layouts—without any coding. Its clean, aesthetic design is perfect for showcasing interior projects, room makeovers, and unique decor pieces. The theme is fully responsive, SEO-optimized, and includes sections for image galleries, blog posts, testimonials, and contact details. Ideal for sharing design inspiration or selling decor items online, the theme integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce to support e-commerce functionality. It works perfectly for furniture stores, decor shops, lifestyle blogs, online interior stores, DIY wall decor, handmade home decor, eco-friendly home decor,luxury furniture, statement pieces, home furnishing architecture studios, home renovation services, and minimal design portfolios. The layout is user-friendly and supports core blocks along with popular plugins like Contact Form 7 for easy form management. With speed-optimized performance and mobile adaptability, your site will load fast and look great on any device. Whether you’re offering style tips, promoting curated collections, running a blog for interior tips, or managing a catalog for modern living spaces, the FSE Home Decor Theme brings your vision to life with style and flexibility. Use this theme for design portfolios, gallery showcases, product listings, or creative studio sites. Its professional aesthetic and intuitive features make it a perfect fit for anyone in the home decor, furnishing, or design space looking to stand out online. Demo Link: https://pattern.cretathemes.com/fse-home-decor/"
    },
